### Placeholder Values Reference

| Placeholder | Description | Example |
|-------------|-------------|---------|
| `<<URI>>` | RTSP resource URL | `rtsp://192.168.1.10/media.mp4` |
| `<<CSeq>>` | Sequence number | `1`, `2`, `3`... |
| `<<User-Agent>>` | Client identifier | `RTSPClient/1.0` |
| `<<Accept>>` | Accepted content type | `application/sdp` |
| `<<Transport>>` | Transport protocol | `RTP/AVP;unicast;client_port=5000-5001` |
| `<<Session>>` | Session identifier | `12345678` |
| `<<Range>>` | Time range | `npt=0-10` |
| `<<Content-Type>>` | Body content type | `text/parameters` |
| `<<Content-Length>>` | Body length in bytes | `0` |
| `<<Location>>` | Redirect URL | `rtsp://newserver/media.mp4` |